VENDORED FILES
--------------
vendor/openusd/ holds two files copied unmodified from OpenUSD at tag
v25.11 (https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD/tree/v25.11):

    vendor/openusd/usd/schema.usda                 <- pxr/usd/usd/schema.usda
    vendor/openusd/codegenTemplates/plugInfo.json  <- pxr/usd/usd/codegenTemplates/plugInfo.json

They are build inputs for `python -m biousd.build_plugin`, which runs
usdGenSchema; the usd-core 25.11 wheel ships neither (the 26.x wheels
ship both, and are used in preference when present). Nothing in them is
imported or executed at runtime. They are Copyright 2016 Pixar and are
distributed under the Tomorrow Open Source Technology License 1.0, which
is the Apache License 2.0 with a modified Section 6 ("Trademarks"); that
license, as shipped with OpenUSD, is reproduced in
vendor/openusd/LICENSE.txt.
